{"name":"Raspberry Rave","hex":"#f62217","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"raspberry","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The plant Rubus idaeus.","Any of many other (but not all) species in the genus Rubus."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Containing or having the flavor/flavour of raspberries.","Of a dark pinkish red."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/raspberry"},{"term":"rave","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An enthusiastic review (such as of a play).","A large-scale dance party with strobe lights and fast-paced electronic dance music, often illegally organized open-air or in underground venues."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To be mentally unclear; to be delirious; to talk or act irrationally; to be wild, furious, or raging.","To speak or write wildly or incoherently."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rave"}],"entries":[{"title":"Raspberry","blocks":[{"text":"The raspberry is the edible fruit of several plant species in the genus Rubus of the rose family, most of which are in the subgenus Idaeobatus. The name also applies to these plants themselves. Raspberries are perennial with woody stems."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Raspberry_-_halved_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg/330px-Raspberry_-_halved_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raspberry","wikidata":"Q13179"},{"title":"Rave","blocks":[{"text":"A rave is a dance party at a warehouse, club, or other public or private venue, typically featuring performances by DJs playing electronic dance music. The style is most associated with the early 1990s dance music scene when DJs played at illegal events in musical styles dominated by electronic dance music from a wide range of sub-genres, including acid house, techno, house, jungle, breakbeat, hardcore, happy hardcore, trance, trap and alternative dance. Occasionally live musicians have been known to perform at raves, in addition to other types of performance artists such as go-go dancers and fire dancers. The music is amplified with a large, powerful sound reinforcement system, typically with large subwoofers to produce a deep bass sound. The music is often accompanied by laser light shows, projected coloured images, visual effects and fog machines."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Sven_Vath_playing_at_Amnesia.JPG/330px-Sven_Vath_playing_at_Amnesia.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rave","wikidata":"Q645767"},{"title":"Raspberry (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Raspberry is a color that resembles the color of raspberries."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Raspberry_-_whole_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg/330px-Raspberry_-_whole_%28Rubus_idaeus%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raspberry_(color)","wikidata":"Q3080423"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Halved_blackberry_%28Rubus_fruticosus%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHalved_blackberry_(Rubus_fruticosus)_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"h